%% Enterprise view: who uses the evaluation and where it sits in the release process.
flowchart LR
  eng[Engineering team] -- pull request --> gate[Release gate in CI]
  gate -- pass --> pilot[Pilot release]
  gate -- fail --> eng
  pilot --> analysts[Analysts]
  analysts -- labels 40 answers --> calib[Judge calibration]
  sec[Security team] -- new attacks --> suite[Red-team suite v2]
  suite --> gate
  calib --> gate
  sponsor[Customer sponsor] -- signs --> memo[Release-readiness memo]
  gate --> memo
